### Storage

- **SQLite**: `evidence`, `receipts`, `provenance` tables (indexed by `run_id`, `evidence_id`)
- **Filesystem**: Evidence payloads at `evidence_root/run_id/evidence_id.jsonl` (JSONL format)
- **Hash Algorithm**: blake3 (default) or SHA-256 (configurable via policy)